# Changelog

## v0.1.0 — release candidate

- {{name}} extracts verbatim statement challenges and bundles requested roots.
- Definition-hole support follows upstream Comparator's explicit contract.
- Native serial checks use strict Comparator comparison plus Lean and Nanoda.
- Includes synthetic deletion/negative controls and pinned ten-proofs results.
- Remaining failures and unsupported language forms are recorded in the validation
  reports; this candidate is not advertised as supporting every Lean construct.
